{"id":1140802,"name":"파인·심문 II","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"파인·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1140802]}],"trial":{"trial_id":140802,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2025-02-27 14:00:00","diary1":"당신은 파인의 지시대로 변장을 한 뒤, 그녀와 함께 헤일을 조사하기 위해 쉐이드 타운으로 향했다.","diary2":"하루 종일 헤일을 관찰하고 조사했는데도 의심스러운 정황이 발견되지 않자, 당신들은 쉐이드 타운의 의원인 워싱턴을 의심하기 시작했다. 한편, 파인의 이야기를 들은 당신은 파인과 워싱턴 사이에 오래된 원한이 있다는 것을 알게 되었다.\n　　그런데 뜻밖에도 이 익명의 제보자는 다름 아닌 헤일 본인이었다.","evidence":[{"ID":260697,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260698,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":240802022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":3,"dialogue_id":240802023,"next":[24]},{"step":24,"course":2,"dialogue_id":24